# Only what ships is tracked: the plugin manifest, the skills, README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG and CI.
# Everything else in this folder (workbench, test images and films, plans, logs, experiments, previews,
# local agent settings) stays on the maintainer's machine.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.claude-plugin/
!/.github/
!/skills/
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/CITATION.cff

# runtime and local data inside the skills
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
models/
history.jsonl
consent.json
*.log
